test: ext4 journal mode warns at Linux 7.3
-- kernel --
7.3.0
-- input --
/dev/sda1 /mnt/ext4 ext4 defaults,data=journal 0 0
-- issues --
Warning: ext4 mount option 'data=journal' is deprecated since kernel 7.3 on line 1; removal is planned for January 2028 (removal kernel version not yet confirmed). Consider the default 'data=ordered' after reviewing its different data-integrity guarantees
